        // For vec4 along n: each group of 4 consecutive n share same k
        // Better: load along weight rows - weight[n_b * K_total + k_base + k]
        // The TILE_N dimension is contiguous if we iterate over n fast
        // sB is stored [k][n], so writing sB[k][n0..n0+3] is contiguous in shared mem
